    "lawCode": "Amd §§2 & 4, Chap 422 of 2008",
    "lawSection": "Public Authorities",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S4207\n\n TITLE OF BILL :\nAn act to amend chapter 422 of the laws of 2008, relating to creating\na public library district in the city of Troy, in the county of\nRensselaer, in relation to extending the period of time during which\nthe Troy public library district may be established\n\n\n PURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL :\nExtends until November 30, 2012 the period of time during which the\nTroy public library district may be established by the voters of the\ncity of Troy.\n\n SUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS :\nSection 1 of the bill amends subdivision 1 of section 2 of chapter 422\nof the laws of 2008 to extend the period of time during which the\nvoters of the city of Troy can approve the Troy public library\ndistrict and budget, and elect trustees until November 30, 2012.\nSection 2 of the bill amends subdivision 1 section 4 of chapter 422 to\nmake technical corrections associated with the date change. Section 3\nis the effective date.\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\nChapter 422 of the laws of 2008 authorized the voters of the city of\nTroy to create the Troy public library district, elect trustees to the\nboard and support a budget. In order for this to be accomplished, all\nthree of these components had to pass the voters.  Unfortunately, only\ntwo of the three were successful, and, because the creation of the\ndistrict was predicated on all three components passing, the new\ndistrict was not created. This bill authorizes the city to hold\nadditional elections to create and fund the Troy public library\ndistrict and elect trustees.\n\n PRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\nNew bill.\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\nNone to state.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nImmediately.\n",
